flowchart TD
  A[Approved Engineering Change Package] --> B[Coder implementation]
  B --> C[Exact Candidate SHA]
  C --> D[Targeted authoritative verification]
  D --> E[Reviewer / required Safety gates]
  E --> F[Readiness validation]
  F --> G[Final Acceptance Suite]
  G -->|Pass| H[Promote]
  G -->|Candidate failure| I[Coder]
  G -->|Test defect| J[Tester]
  G -->|Architecture defect| K[Planner / reapproval]
  G -->|Environment failure| L[Environment repair]
  G -->|Ambiguous| M[Debugger if retained]
  H --> N[Project Baseline / Savepoint]
